  "code" : "public int majorityElement(int[] nums) {\n    int count = 0, el = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {\n        if (count == 0) {\n            count = 1; el = nums[i];\n        } else if (nums[i] == el) {\n            count++;\n        } else {\n            count--;\n        }\n    }\n    return el;\n}",
